cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the Marian Protocol v1.0, cite the technical specification below.
  The manuscript book is separately copyrighted; no DOI has yet been assigned.
title: "Marian Protocol v1.0: An Operating Calendar for Human Mars"
type: generic
version: "1.0"
authors:
  - name: "JB Bullock"
abstract: >-
  Author-ratified civil-calendar specification for Mars: 668/669-sol years,
  59/100 intercalation, 12 months, 24 minths, shortened terminal civil weeks,
  Airy Mean Time reference profile and parameterized future MY1 epoch.
